    "sentence_translations": [
      "(15) Very Happy",
      "",
      "Old Guan is very busy. Little Dong is also very busy. Little Dong is now rarely alone.",
      "His dad and mom realized that he didn’t like being alone at home.",
      "Now, when Mom works, Dad is at home. When Dad works, Mom is at home. Little Dong is very happy.",
      "",
      "On this day, Little Dong gave Old Guan a call.",
      "",
      "“Hello? Hello,” Old Guan said.",
      "",
      "“Hello? Old Guan, it’s me!” Little Dong said.",
      "",
      "“Little Dong! How have you been this week?” Old Guan asked.",
      "",
      "“I’m well. I have a person that I like. You know that, right? I think she also likes me.",
      "I saw my name on her book!” Little Dong said.",
      "",
      "“Great, great. This week, I learned to make fruit rice. My friends all really like it.",
      "When Little Dong comes to Beijing, I will also make it for you to eat,” Old Guan said.",
      "",
      "Old Guan and Little Dong were both very happy, and they both smiled."
    ]
  }
